# Stone stairs, ascending toward +x: three cut steps, each nosing notched
# into five blocks with thin channels between, on a one-twelfth base course
# between a low front curb and a full-height curb along the back, so the
# flight reads as dressed masonry. Same ramp physics as the plain stairs;
# only the boxes differ.
version 1
shape stairs_stone
grid 12
states facing
ramp
box all  0 0 0  12 1 12
box all  0 1 0  1 4 12
box all  11 1 0  12 12 12
box all  1 1 1  11 3 11
box all  1 3 0  5 4 1
box all  3 3 1  11 4 11
box all  1 3 2  3 4 4
box all  1 3 5  3 4 7
box all  1 3 8  3 4 10
box all  1 3 11  5 4 12
box all  4 4 0  5 8 12
box all  5 4 1  11 7 11
box all  5 7 0  9 8 1
box all  7 7 1  11 8 11
box all  5 7 2  7 8 4
box all  5 7 5  7 8 7
box all  5 7 8  7 8 10
box all  5 7 11  9 8 12
box all  8 8 0  9 12 12
box all  9 8 1  11 11 11
box all  9 11 0  11 12 1
box all  9 11 2  11 12 4
box all  9 11 5  11 12 7
box all  9 11 8  11 12 10
box all  9 11 11  11 12 12
